WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
When the Federal Reserve
moves interest rates,

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.260
it makes headlines across the country.

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:08.120
Its choices ripple out to
the rates on car loans,

4
00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:10.330
credit cards and mortgages.

5
00:00:10.330 --> 00:00:13.590
Yet no American can open
a checking account there.

6
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.770
So why can't you open an
account at a central bank,

7
00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.730
and what does it do instead?

8
00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.710
In this mission, you'll map
what a central bank does,

9
00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:24.390
and the goals the Fed is told to aim for.

10
00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:26.790
Then you'll open the Fed's toolbox,

11
00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.830
from the discount rate
to interest on reserves.

12
00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:33.650
Your mission: find out what
a central bank is really for.
